en  never surfaced during the final battle  whether or not they'll change their ways  remains to be seen to be clear there can  absolutely be a role for non-violent  resistors and instances of Oppression  but when the very survival of your  species is on the line that role can be  hard to find humanity isn't gonna stop  their Conquest with a few whales and a  little bit of forest they're coming for  the whole planet and when they do a  whole herd of Tolkien could be a  valuable weapon and the fight for  Freedom May Maybe by account can  convince his community to break their  rules just as once at the very least it  would be nice to see him we admitted  into their ranks the first avatar  doesn't provide a lot of details about  how the Tree of Souls works but the way  of water gives us some interesting new  Clues through the Met kaina's underwater  Spirit tree we see multiple characters  bond with the tree and have curious  Visions however it's still not entirely  clear what they're seeing when Kiri  bonds with the tree she sees her mother  working in a lab the two have a  conversation that's quickly cut off  after Kiri starts asking questions Grace  appears to be yanked away from her and  Kiri starts convulsing from a seizure in  the real world later at the end of the  movie Jake and natiri bonds with the  tree and see their son netiam this  vision is different from curie's because  it appears to be a memory an echo of a  moment at the start of the film that  shows Jake's training that I am to fish  because Kiri never met her mother her  vision couldn't possibly be a memory so  what's happening here are Jake and  natiri actually communing with their  son's spirit is Grace's Soul still alive  in awe as a result of how she died the  spiritual aspects of Pandora may never  be fully explained which isn't a bad  thing but in this case it would be great  to learn a little bit more and Ravi read  their planet of humans at the end of the  original Avatar but things aren't so  simple in the sequel the big action  climax sees the rda's whaling ship  destroyed but Humanity's operations back  in the forest are presumably still going  strong so what's next for the RDA and  how will they respond to the battle on  the reefs if General Ardmore is to be  believed more human forces are coming  she says that she's been sent to tame  this Frontier gesturing to Pandora at  large is to be the new home for Humanity  if the RDA get their way which would  surely Doom the planet with the very  survival of the species apparently at  stake we've likely only seen a fraction  of the military might that's coming the  navi will have a big fight on their  hands of the colonization efforts  continue to gain steam how that fight  takes shape however remains to be seen  could Humanity create a whole Army of  Avatar soldiers to adapt to Pandora's  environment it seems likely could they  stop plundering the spiritual energy of  the planet in addition to his other  natural resources also a possibility the  future looks Grim for the navi but with  a united front they still have a chance  though he's a trained soldier Jake Sully  is Running Scared for most of Avatar the  way of water when he realizes how great  the danger to his children is he  completely abandons his Crusade against  the RDA and dedicates all his energy to  keeping his family safe throughout the  film we see Jake humble himself to the  Mets kaina courage and others to protect  his own but by the end he realizes that  isn't going to cut it anymore Jake saves  in the film's closing narration I can't  save my family by running this suggests  that he's accepted tonawari's invitation  to stay with the mechano rather than  flee again the death of netiam has  changed Jake's perspective and he now  knows that fighting back is the only way  to earn peace however he doesn't give us  many real clues about his next move  let's get it done staying with the Mets  kaina could have some benefits for sure  but so could moving on to yet another  Nabi Clan if the RDA is to be fully  defeated Pandora needs to be United  staying on the Move also isn't a bad  idea and it isn't the same as running  away whatever happens the sullies have  their work cut out for them but they  seem more than up to the task after the  way of water  [Music]
 

